    "detailed_description": "<h1>DON'T FORGET TO WHISTLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344550/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1755413126\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344550/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1755413126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344550/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1755413126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness of your room, you start with a seemingly harmless game on your phone. But whenever you open a drawer in the game, it creaks open in your actual room, blurring the line between digital and reality. This game-within-a-game experience begins in a single room and spreads throughout your entire house as the tension multiplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cSwept Under\u201d</strong> is inspired by analog horror elements and unfolds within a psychological horror atmosphere. Every move you make has real-world consequences, creating a one-of-a-kind interactive terror experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready to be scared?</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness of your room, you start with a seemingly harmless game on your phone. But whenever you open a drawer in the game, it creaks open in your actual room, blurring the line between digital and reality. This game-within-a-game experience begins in a single room and spreads throughout your entire house as the tension multiplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cSwept Under\u201d</strong> is inspired by analog horror elements and unfolds within a psychological horror atmosphere. Every move you make has real-world consequences, creating a one-of-a-kind interactive terror experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready to be scared?</h2>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019re playing an innocent game on your phone in a dark room, but every drawer you open and every step you take in the game echoes in the real world. A unique, interactive horror experience where psychological terror and a game-within-a-game concept gradually ratchet up the tension.",
